5.2 Part 2: Add the Provided Code
Copy these folders into your CubeIDE project root:
app/
drivers/
bsp/
Add include paths if needed:
app
drivers
bsp
Modify main.c only inside user-code sections.
Add:
/* USER CODE BEGIN Includes */
#include "app.h"
/* USER CODE END Includes */
Call the app after CubeMX initialization:
/* USER CODE BEGIN 2 */
app_main();
/* USER CODE END 2 */
app_main() does not return, so the CubeMX while (1) can remain empty.

